A||||5||Hank is Here||Rims from new Grand Am?||||1||
Z||000000||Hank is Here||10-15-2000||11:15 PM||||This weekend I saw a new Grand Am GT with 16" chrome or polished aluminum rims on it.  The appeared really nice even with a Pontiac center logo. Would these fit a Fiero?  Would anyone know the bolt pattern and offset of the Rims on the new Grand Am? <P>Mark Johnson ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Spyro86SE||10-16-2000||01:03 AM||||no they wont fit the bolt pattern is to big and the offset is to off and they are plastic covers over aluminum rims ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||10-16-2000||04:05 AM||||The 1998 G/A wheels were the last year that fit the Fiero<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||14
Z||000003||Haze_Performance||10-16-2000||04:06 AM||||The 1998 G/A wheels were the last year that fit the Fiero. But the new Sunfires up to 2001 will fit,<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||14
Z||000004||Haze_Performance||10-16-2000||04:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spyro86SE:<BR><B>no they wont fit the bolt pattern is to big and the offset is to off and they are plastic covers over aluminum rims </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The offset is the same....but your right about the bolt pattern. Its larger on 99/00<P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||12
